  "details": "If join a world on Android, and someone with a Very Poor avatar with an impostor is already in the world. When you show their avatar, it will use the fallback instead of the impostor. This also happens with the other user. If you join a world with an avatar that has an impostor, others will not be able to see the impostor, until you switch to a different avatar.\n\nTested on PC 1405 and Android 1405",
